Z||000004||My7Fieros||10-11-2001||01:37 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 85ZainoGT:<BR><B>ok thanks, I am going to head to Ace Hardware tomorrow to see what I can find, is there any easy way to get the bulbs out?<P>[This message has been edited by 85ZainoGT (edited 10-10-2001).]</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Lol Ace is actually the hardware store I got mine at so you'll def find them there! <BR>Just pull them out..they may be a bit stubborn, but they'll come out.<P><P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="blue"><B><I>My 7 Fieros</FONT></FONT></B></I>||||reg||1
